    "summary": "Errata changing Chaos Space Marines datasheet characteristics. Unit changes:\n\n- Toughness 6: Sorcerer in Terminator Armour, Kravek Morne, Huron Blackheart, Chaos Terminator Squad, Chaos Lord in Terminator Armour, Chaos Bikers and Abaddon the Despoiler\n- Toughness 5: Warp Talons, Warpsmith, Sorcerer, Red Corsairs Reave-Captain, Red Corsairs Raiders, Raptors, Nemesis Claw, the 3 Masters of the Maelstrom models (Katar Garrix, Garreon the Corpsemaster and Garlon Souleater), Master of Possession, Master of Executions, Legionaries, Haarken Worldclaimer, Fabius Bile, Dark Apostle, Cypher, Chosen, Chaos Lord with Jump Pack and Chaos Lord\n- Wounds 3: Havocs\n\nWeapon changes:\n\n- Astartes chainsword, Strength 5: Raptors, Nemesis Claw, Legionaries, Havocs, Chaos Lord and Chaos Bikers\n- Bolt pistol, Strength 5 and AP -1: Sorcerer, Red Corsairs Reave-Captain, Red Corsairs Raiders, Raptors, Nemesis Claw, Masters of the Maelstrom, Master of Possession, Master of Executions, Lord Discordant on Helstalker, Legionaries, Havocs, Dark Apostle, Chosen, Chaos Lord with Jump Pack and Chaos Bikers\n- Boltgun, Strength 5 and AP -1: Red Corsairs Raiders, Nemesis Claw, Legionaries, Havocs and Chosen\n- Combi-bolter, Strength 5 and AP -1: Chaos Land Raider, Sorcerer in Terminator Armour, Kravek Morne, Helbrute, Chaos Vindicator, Chaos Terminators, Chaos Rhino, Chaos Predator Destructor, Chaos Predator Annihilator, Chaos Lord in Terminator Armour and Chaos Bikers\n- Combi-weapon, Strength 5 and AP -1: Chaos Land Raider, Sorcerer in Terminator Armour, Chosen, Chaos Vindicator, Chaos Terminators, Chaos Rhino, Chaos Predator Destructor, Chaos Predator Annihilator and Chaos Lord in Terminator Armour\n- Close combat weapon, Strength 5: Raptors, Legionaries, Havocs and Chaos Bikers\n- Cypher's Bolt Pistol, ranged and melee, Strength 5: Cypher\n- Hideous Mutations, Strength 6: Possessed\n- Nostraman chainblade, Strength 5: Nemesis Claw",
